  "title": "Nothin' Sweet About These Spicy Refrigerator Pickles",
  "description": "There is nothin' sweet about these spicy refrigerator pickles, ready in just 24 hours. The recipe's key is the variety of ingredients and reduced sugar.",
  "authors": [
